<title>USA: Southwest Bancorp Inc raises qtly div.</title>
<headline>Southwest Bancorp Inc raises qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>STILLWATER, Okla. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Bancorp Inc said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.08 per share from $0.07 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on April 1 to shareholders of record on March 18.</p>
</text>
